      m_Calls: []
  m_text: Control runes that are capable of containing another rune within their symbol are simply known as container runes, with the central rune known as its focus. Often, these runes are capable of supporting a number of parameters that orbit the circular central focus in a geometrically stable pattern. These can be inscribed by drawing the parameter rune inside the control rune. Parameters may contain any type of rune, including other control runes.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0dbaabea45853494293403a1c4741dc3, type: 2}
